<title>JAPAN: Unisia Jecs - 6-mth group forecast.</title>
<headline>Unisia Jecs - 6-mth group forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six month to March 31,1997</p>
<p>(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>		     LATEST 6-MTH    ACTUAL 7-MTH</p>
<p> (Group)	     FORECAST	  RESULTS</p>
<p> Sales		109.00	     127.08</p>
<p> Current		2.00		 2.86</p>
<p> Net		    1.10		 1.68</p>
<p> EPS		    7.18 yen	  10.99 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Unisia Jecs Corp is a car parts maker affiliated</p>
<p>with Nissan Motor Co Ltd. The latest forecasts were</p>
<p>for the six-month period ending on March 31, 1997, because</p>
<p>the company changed its business term.</p>
</text>
